{{Politics of Balisca}}
The '''2024 confederal election''' will be held on 6 October 2024, in which voters will elect all 736 delegates of the [[Confederal Congress]]. This will be the first confederal election since the [[2022 Baliscan constitutional referendum|implementation]] of the 2022 [[Constitution of Balisca]].

